6905", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031518_1113760809920238_374040494887525675_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HelOcj783ZUQ7kNvwFtzH6c&_nc_oc=AdreU4O0Jtb7LWJr_EP-Z1-d3BL1fnjQ7BWvRiu2bV7XuupzUES_wP5ac-YVV6-FtJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7snGc1MqSfwfSPzcMXEm3AT2YBXYzL1qTLj_pvBvHrTw&oe=6A11AB45"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-1.png", "id": "832532242169712", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031457_832532248836378_3663210356497322076_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ieOk63wYSVUQ7kNvwFR-dtb&_nc_oc=Adqg0JjqWGpz4EloE_1POYoD1_AKOsDNyrDzCYJBBLSs1VLRz2leJuI_6hmkfsQDs58&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4F_btCHx-dEqmgA5haglKYnKZPtHoKXdwEf4eF2YMhJA&oe=6A11AD11"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Shotta video cover.png", "id": "998125558115830", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974670_998125561449163_5721044183343334113_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QaUT095x74wQ7kNvwFKEcz1&_nc_oc=AdqQpjArBR05L-aqCuXORXqqfleoZ9Ws_AwLCv_q30zaaOZ228jdpHda7HGCywh7He4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5cUQtvGEaOOUrj1u2Aryi-YeQQ9oQM6xxtOPtjV4lRZA&oe=6A11CB4B"}, "display_name": "No Games - Drum & Bass Music Studio", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Play incredible Drum & Bass live in multiplayer, with the sounds of UK rapper Harry Shotta and acclaimed producer Erb n Dub. \n\nMix and match hard-hitting drum sounds to generate the perfect DNB beat. Compose wicked and wild bass lines by moving the controllers around, adding hair-raising effects, all on top of Harry Shotta's classic jump-up style rap virtuosity.\n\nPlay solo or with up to 15 friends to have your own virtual DNB rave in VR!", "short_description": "Play incredible Drum & Bass live in multiplayer, with the sounds of UK rapper Harry Shotta and acclaimed produce